Package: gristmillr
Title: Work with the 'Grist' Spreadsheet API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Eli", "Pousson", , "eli.pousson@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8280-1706"))
Description: Read and write data in 'Grist' <https://www.getgrist.com/>
    documents using the 'Grist' REST API. Functions are built on 'httr2',
    take and return data frames, and use plain handle objects instead of
    stateful classes so they work well in tidyverse-style pipelines.
